</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fb4170f0-7a08-11f1-aba7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/ap26168698034901-1.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fb4170f0-7a08-11f1-aba7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/ap26168698034901-1.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">06e08fba-7aa2-11f1-bdfe-2f588a807571</guid><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 07:53:06 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fb4170f0-7a08-11f1-aba7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/ap26168698034901-1.jpg">©  Amirhosein Khorgooi / AP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Macron says Syria must not be destabilised after bombs wound 18</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260708-macron-says-syria-must-not-be-destabilised-after-bombs-wound-18</link><description>
French President Emmanuel Macron warned on Tuesday that Syria must not be destabilised after twin bomb attacks near the Damascus hotel where he spent the night, during a landmark state visit to a country emerging from years of civil war. 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/780605c2-79de-11f1-8f02-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T075456Z-1831489698-RC2V8MAKAC5N-RTRMADP-3-SYRIA-POLITICS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/780605c2-79de-11f1-8f02-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T075456Z-1831489698-RC2V8MAKAC5N-RTRMADP-3-SYRIA-POLITICS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8cb107c6-7a9f-11f1-bbd5-2f588a807571</guid><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 07:40:43 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/780605c2-79de-11f1-8f02-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T075456Z-1831489698-RC2V8MAKAC5N-RTRMADP-3-SYRIA-POLITICS.jpg">© 路透社图片</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Greenland 'not for sale', Danish PM says at NATO summit</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260708-greenland-not-for-sale-danish-pm-says-at-nato-summit</link><description>
